1. LGPL components (Rust)
--------------------------------------------------------------------

  rawler 0.7.2                LGPL-2.1
      RAW decoding and metadata. See DECISIONS.md ADR-0002.

  lensfun 0.7.0               LGPL-3.0-or-later
      Lens and camera correction database. See DECISIONS.md ADR-0039.

  gphoto2 3.4.1               LGPL-2.1-only
  libgphoto2_sys 1.2.3        LGPL-2.1-only
      Tethered shooting. OPTIONAL: built only with the `tethering`
      Cargo feature, which is off by default.

These are used unmodified, as libraries. Because Aperture X itself is
distributed as open source with its complete corresponding source code,
the relinking requirement of LGPL-2.1 section 6 / LGPL-3.0 section 4 is
satisfied by that source distribution: a user can replace any of these
libraries and rebuild.

A closed-source distribution of Aperture X would NOT be covered by that
reasoning and would need a separate arrangement (see DECISIONS.md
ADR-0002 point 2).

